      "subtitle": "Auto-sensing acupressure, no needles",
      "material": "ABS and aluminium alloy",
      "descriptionHtml": "<p><b>No needles. Just real acupressure.</b> The AcuNova pen finds the point and delivers gentle electronic stimulation at the push of a button - the same meridian-point technique behind traditional acupuncture, without the needles, the training or the appointment.</p>\n<h3>What it actually does</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Auto point-sensing:</b> the tip responds as it passes over an active point, so you do not need to have memorised a meridian chart to use it properly.</li>\n<li><b>Interchangeable heads:</b> a 3-head tip for precise work on smaller areas, or a 5-head tip that covers a broad muscle group faster.</li>\n<li><b>Oil-free or oil-infused:</b> the oil-infused heads glide more smoothly, which most people prefer on the neck and shoulders.</li>\n<li><b>ABS and aluminium alloy body:</b> built for daily handling rather than a drawer.</li>\n<li><b>Genuinely portable:</b> it lives in a desk drawer, a gym bag or a carry-on.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Who it is for</h3>\n<p>Anyone dealing with everyday muscle tension, stiffness or general stress who wants a faster, needle-free alternative to a clinic appointment - at home, on your own schedule.</p>\n<p><b>Important:</b> this is a wellness and massage tool, not a medical device. It is not cleared by the FDA or Health Canada, and nothing about it treats, cures or prevents any condition. Avoid use over broken skin or varicose veins, and speak to a doctor first if you are pregnant, have a pacemaker or other implanted electronic device, or have any ongoing medical condition.</p>",
